,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 372","text":"Pass this reported annual financial base, calculation bridges, adjustment register, segment/channel data and qualified debt/liquidity schedules to CP-OS and **CP-1A**. CP-1A can proceed with the historical business and transaction fact pack using these facts, without waiting for unrelated analytical modules. Carry the exact consolidated entity scope, source version, timing restriction and distinction between historical financing and any proposed deal.","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 374","text":"Before final delivery, confirm the information-cutoff convention and retain the separate October dividend/draw narrative alongside, not inside, the year-end charts. If the next consumer needs legal capacity, covenant headroom, normalized earnings or an all-funding cash-runway model, obtain the specific missing operands and documents first. This handoff is an intermediate financial foundation, not certification that those downstream conclusions are complete.","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null}],"limitation":"Actual analytical handoff; underlying source qualifications and scope remain.","extractor":"literal-markdown-lines","extraction_status":"complete","coverage":[]},{"schema_version":"source/1","source_id":"CP-1A","name":"CP-1A.md","status":"ready","sha256":"07ccccb4746145afa4449b1b450050463782c3069199127ef051670bfceea5b2","media_type":"text/markdown","spans":[{"locator":"line 1","text":"## Request","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 3","text":"Establish the business, ownership, operating-model and historical transaction context for **TransDigm Group Incorporated**, as of **2024-09-30**, for the credit snapshot. The comparison is FY2024 versus FY2023, in USD. Thi