55 prints \u201cAvailability on Securitization Facility 163\u201d in USD millions. These differing precisions are quoted without averaging, choosing a true balance or declaring equivalence. CP-1 preserves its debt-table basis; this module does not create an exact liquidity sum or borrowing-base calculation from these spans. Obtain a dated agent balance and eligibility certificate before precise runway work.","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 149","text":"Different distribution presentations are not silently reconciled: CP-1 retains the annual cash-flow aggregate separately from the November event amount, year-end payable and October settlement. Those quantities cover different timing and components. Their exact roll-forward remains a gap, not an invented conflict resolution. No other contradiction was established in the bounded read scope; this is not an exhaustive conflict clearance.","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 151","text":"## Calculations","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 153","text":"No new financial arithmetic was performed. Monetary transaction amounts, dates, coupons and margins above are direct source disclosures. The following are references to accepted CP-1 facts, not recalculations or new covenant measures.","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 155","text":"| Inherited fact | Period, currency, unit and quantity | Underlying locator retained by CP-1 | Limitation preserved |","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note":null},{"locator":"line 156","text":"| --- | --- | --- | --- |","formula":null,"cached_value":null,"hidden":false,"data_type":null,"number_format":null,"note"